# SecScan: intentionally empty Betterleaks ignore file (M4b / D-037).
# Passed to `betterleaks dir` with --gitleaks-ignore-path so the scanned repo's own .betterleaksignore /
# .gitleaksignore (whose default lookup path is ".") is never read. It lists NO fingerprints, so it suppresses
